==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Kakuna}}.
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Team Up|Kakuna|4}} from the {{TCG|Team Up}} expansion.
*{{m|String Shot}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Kakuna}} can learn as a {{p|Weedle}}, or via [[Move Tutor]] in [[Generation IV]].
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|X}}.

